{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensing and motion. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, ensuring conservative obstacle recovery and efficient exploration. Recovery states use directed turns or full scan only as needed, and random_walk is used for coverage in clear states. All transitions are deterministic and total with respect to uncontrollables.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion to clarify uncontrollable and controllable event domains.",
    "Specification automaton enforces safe action selection, conservative obstacle recovery, and efficient alternation between exploration and recovery."
  ],
